#### Baselines.

We first evaluate stronger models as the self-evolving policy fψf\_{\psi} while keeping Qwen3-4B-Instruct as the action policy πθ\pi\_{\theta}. We consider two frontier closed-source models, GPT-5 (OpenAI, [2025](https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2603.18620v1#bib.bib34 "OpenAI gpt-5 system card")) and Claude Sonnet 4.5 (Anthropic, [2025](https://ar5iv.labs.arxiv.org/html/2603.18620v1#bib.bib36 "System card: claude opus 4.5"))

